What this repository actually contributes
-----------------------------------------
Not new algorithms. It contributes: measured calibration data reproduced on
a second target page, a decision table that maps verification codes to fixes,
three failure samples from a second domain, and two non-captcha gotchas
(CDP frame flooding, session-bound download URLs) that cost real hours.

