Third-party — kangleyao/slider-captcha-lab
https://github.com/kangleyao/slider-captcha-lab

Contribution used here: the quadratic displacement model for AliyunCaptcha
(`piece.left = A·m + B·m²`), the human-shaped trajectory generator, the
CDP injection approach, and the verification-code reading method.

The coefficients published in this repository (A_CDP = 0.0769,
B_CDP = 0.003552) were independently re-measured and reproduced on a
different target page; the success and failure samples under `examples/`
are local work, not upstream data.

